{"id": 7782020841670, "title": "Natural Breast Pump Wipes - Safe & Convenient", "body_html": "<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Natural &amp; Effective Cleaning</strong> – With grapefruit essence and baking soda, Momcozy breast pump wipes provide a refreshing and thorough clean.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Quick &amp; Easy Wipe-Down </strong>– Designed with a thicker and larger build, they easily remove breast milk residue and grime in a single swipe, saving time and effort.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Clean Anytime, Anywhere</strong> – Perfect for on-the-go moms, these breast pump wipes ensure hassle-free cleaning anytime, anywhere.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Multipurpose &amp; Gentle </strong>– Ideal for breast pump parts, breast shields, lactation massagers, bottles, pacifiers, and more., ensuring a safe and fresh feeding experience.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Compact &amp; Travel-Ready </strong>– Convenient resealable 30-count pack, easy to store in a diaper bag or purse for daily convenience.</span></p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Accessories", "created_at": "2023-04-19T08:06:30-04:00", "handle": "natural-breast-pump-wipes-fast-convenient", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:53-04:00", "published_at": "2023-05-06T02:22:37-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-wipes", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 吸奶器清洁, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 42668886393030, "product_id": 7782020841670, "title": "30 Count (Pack of 3)", "price": "17.09", "sku": "WI003-WH43NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "18.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "30 Count (Pack of 3)", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2023-04-19T08:06:31-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:53-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "96205927376", "grams": 0, "image_id": 42792103018694, "weight": 0.0, "weight_unit": "k